Z||000000||Blade||08-21-2000||07:26 PM||||First how good a deal did i get??<BR>I am buying and 86 SE 71000 miles <BR>V6 seems to run great tranny tight ect.<BR>Needs a bunch of little things door handel locks things like that. Front has been hit has a small(1 inch) crack. rest of body looks clean.<P>2nd what is the difference betweent the 86 se and 86 gt. The person im buying this car from told me the only dif was the spoiler. Im just curious how acurate this is. Im been sorting through posts and it looks like ill have fun with this car.<P>Blade||||reg||1
Z||000001||contra||08-21-2000||07:53 PM||||The '86 SE is a notch back and the '86 GT is a fastback. the '86 SE looks identical to the '85 GT's. They both have V6's<BR>spoilers were an option, you could choose between no spoiler, spoiler, or luggage rack.||||reg||1
